Package: com.vo1dek.wipecode
Name: WipeCode
Version: 2.6
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: Adds a WipeCode pane to Settings, where a second wipe password is set, and performs an authenticated "Erase All Content and Settings" through SpringBoard. The Settings pane and the SpringBoard half are one dylib injected into both processes.
